Craklyn's Odin Banter Trigger~
0 b 6
~
eval phrase %random.3%
if %phrase% == 1
say The unwise man thinks that he always will live, if from the fighting he flees; but the ails and aches of old age dog him though spears have spared him. 
elseif %phrase% == 2
say The unwise man waketh all night, thinking of this and that tosses and turns, sleepless, and is tired at morn: nor lighter for that his load.
else
say Soon must rise who would take another's life and win his wealth; lying down wolf never got the lamb, nor sleeping man slew his foe.
end
~
$~
